    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987120/extras/dc4c66ff939ede80349a8251fdc1a636.avif?t=1720713919\" width=622 height=114 /></span><br>Embark on a journey into the heart of ancient traditions with &quot;River God: Enshrouded Current,&quot; where an ancient village struggles with a curse entwined in the very fabric of its existence. Unravel the secrets of a malevolent priest whose dark rituals bind the village to a realm beyond the living.<br><br>As the protagonist, you navigate the decaying village, a spectral echo of its former self. The rituals, steeped in ancient mystique, unfold through cryptic puzzles, exposing the priest's deceitful influence and the village's tragic destiny.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987120/extras/4b48eb4772860d73231dd68138acb62e.avif?t=1720713919\" width=622 height=114 /></span><br>&quot;River God: Enshrouded Current&quot; seamlessly fuses narrative and gameplay, offering an atmospheric horror experience. Navigate the village's decayed remnants, solve puzzles, and face spectral entities. Each choice you make uncovers the priest's manipulation, guiding you towards lifting the ancient curse. Dive into the forgotten marsh, confront the horrors, and unveil the secrets that will free both the living and the dead.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987120/extras/ecd3be08332863a34e2e645669d0513d.avif?t=1720713919\" width=622 height=114 /></span><br><br>Explore the Forgotten: Immerse yourself in the eerie ambiance of the marsh, each step revealing the village's tragic history and ancient Chinese rituals.\t\t\t\t<br>\t\t\t\t<br>Cryptic Puzzles: Unravel the priest's secrets through intricate puzzles that challenge your intellect and guide you through the village's haunting past.\t\t\t\t<br>\t\t\t\t<br>Tortured Spirits: Encounter spectral entities bound by the curse, each holding a piece of the puzzle, leading you towards salvation.\t\t\t\t<br>\t\t\t\t<br>Cultural Mystique: Discover the village's rich cultural heritage, exploring ancient Chinese rituals, mystical symbols, and traditions that hint at a destiny intertwined with the supernatural.\t\t\t\t<br>\t\t\t\t<br>Engaging Gameplay: Blend exploration, puzzle-solving, and supernatural encounters in a first-person horror experience, where every step reveals more about the village's dark past.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987120/extras/dc4c66ff939ede80349a8251fdc1a636.avif?t=1720713919\" width=622 height=114 /></span><br>Embark on a journey into the heart of ancient traditions with &quot;River God: Enshrouded Current,&quot; where an ancient village struggles with a curse entwined in the very fabric of its existence. Unravel the secrets of a malevolent priest whose dark rituals bind the village to a realm beyond the living.<br><br>As the protagonist, you navigate the decaying village, a spectral echo of its former self. The rituals, steeped in ancient mystique, unfold through cryptic puzzles, exposing the priest's deceitful influence and the village's tragic destiny.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987120/extras/4b48eb4772860d73231dd68138acb62e.avif?t=1720713919\" width=622 height=114 /></span><br>&quot;River God: Enshrouded Current&quot; seamlessly fuses narrative and gameplay, offering an atmospheric horror experience. Navigate the village's decayed remnants, solve puzzles, and face spectral entities. Each choice you make uncovers the priest's manipulation, guiding you towards lifting the ancient curse. Dive into the forgotten marsh, confront the horrors, and unveil the secrets that will free both the living and the dead.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987120/extras/ecd3be08332863a34e2e645669d0513d.avif?t=1720713919\" width=622 height=114 /></span><br><br>Explore the Forgotten: Immerse yourself in the eerie ambiance of the marsh, each step revealing the village's tragic history and ancient Chinese rituals.\t\t\t\t<br>\t\t\t\t<br>Cryptic Puzzles: Unravel the priest's secrets through intricate puzzles that challenge your intellect and guide you through the village's haunting past.\t\t\t\t<br>\t\t\t\t<br>Tortured Spirits: Encounter spectral entities bound by the curse, each holding a piece of the puzzle, leading you towards salvation.\t\t\t\t<br>\t\t\t\t<br>Cultural Mystique: Discover the village's rich cultural heritage, exploring ancient Chinese rituals, mystical symbols, and traditions that hint at a destiny intertwined with the supernatural.\t\t\t\t<br>\t\t\t\t<br>Engaging Gameplay: Blend exploration, puzzle-solving, and supernatural encounters in a first-person horror experience, where every step reveals more about the village's dark past.",
